<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是变量吗</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>模型没换，换的是那圈 —— 结果差了将近三倍</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 40}}><Box style={{width: 430, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 104, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0, letterSpacing: -2}}>38.3%</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", marginTop: 12}}>同一个模型 · ARC-AGI-3（2026-08-20 前后）</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 26}}>换之前是 13.3%</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 10}}>同一套评测、同一个模型，只有模型外面那圈换了。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 682, flexDirection: "column", gap: 14, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>什么没变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>还是那个模型</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>什么变了</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>模型外面那圈——开源的不是模型，是那圈</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 16, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#8A5A00", lineHeight: 1.6}}>⚠️ 厂商自述 —— 官方博客公布的数字，未经独立第三方审计，请按自述来听。</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)", lineHeight: 1.6, padding: 14, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}>口径：原文说的是「输出 token」约 1/6，不是整个任务的 token。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>21 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
